message.content:
Christmas decorative shelf sitters made of textile fabric are festive articles, classified in heading 9505. Subheading 9505.10 covers articles for Christmas festivities. Textile ones fall under 9505.10.25 ("Other" Christmas ornaments and festive articles of textile materials). The 9505.10.25 line is "Other: Of textile materials" in the 9505.10.2500 statistical breakdown. Specifically, 9505.10.15 is glass, 9505.10.25 is "Other" (nativity scenes and other articles in the Christmas ornament and decoration set), 9505.10.35 is "Other: of wood," 9505.10.40 is "Other: of paper," and 9505.10.50 is "Other." Textile articles such as Santa figures are usually classified in 9505.10.2500, which is "Other: Of textile materials." This item is also "Christmas stockings and Santa figures," which are textiles under 9505.10.25.

I'm fairly confident the answer is 9505.10.2500.

